    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city built around the Gate of Origins,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >head to the tavern to meet like-minded companions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >recruit seasoned adventurers at the guild,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arm yourself and your allies with crystals and potions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and embark on your journey to the Origin Realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very easy to get into the game flow and a rich variety of growth systems!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 16 characters can join the adventure, each with their own unique combat style and skills!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a wide variety of enemies, and defeating each type grants corresponding imprints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprints can be equipped on characters to enhance their combat power. Repeatedly defeating the same enemy can also increase the imprint's level!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each character can equip multiple imprints; the more enemies you defeat, the more diverse the imprints become, and the stronger their abilities!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wealth of equipment and enhancement crystals available for collection and purchase, along with flexible and varied imprint ability combinations, make the adventurer's growth strategic and diverse!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almost every combat skill has proficiency; the more you use it, the stronger the skill becomes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Losing a battle does not end the game; instead, you enter the next cycle, retaining all skill proficiency and acquired imprints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of the cycle has levels; the higher the level, the greater the rewards from adventures!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This means that even if you continuously lose, your combat power will accumulate until you become invincible!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 26 dungeons with different styles and enemies await players to explore and conquer in various ways!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city built around the Gate of Origins,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >head to the tavern to meet like-minded companions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >recruit seasoned adventurers at the guild,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arm yourself and your allies with crystals and potions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and embark on your journey to the Origin Realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very easy to get into the game flow and a rich variety of growth systems!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 16 characters can join the adventure, each with their own unique combat style and skills!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a wide variety of enemies, and defeating each type grants corresponding imprints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprints can be equipped on characters to enhance their combat power. Repeatedly defeating the same enemy can also increase the imprint's level!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each character can equip multiple imprints; the more enemies you defeat, the more diverse the imprints become, and the stronger their abilities!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wealth of equipment and enhancement crystals available for collection and purchase, along with flexible and varied imprint ability combinations, make the adventurer's growth strategic and diverse!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almost every combat skill has proficiency; the more you use it, the stronger the skill becomes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Losing a battle does not end the game; instead, you enter the next cycle, retaining all skill proficiency and acquired imprints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of the cycle has levels; the higher the level, the greater the rewards from adventures!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This means that even if you continuously lose, your combat power will accumulate until you become invincible!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 26 dungeons with different styles and enemies await players to explore and conquer in various ways!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Who am I? Where am I? It doesn\u2019t matter; I\u2019m here to slay enemies! Head to the dungeon, continuously fight, and eliminate powerful foes. Absorb the power of imprints and challenge the mightiest dungeons in Abyalkin!",
